> where ticks are to appear] and XTickLabels={array of strings}.

See the scales argument on ?trellis.args.  For example:

library(trellis)
X <- runif(20)
Y <- rnorm(20)

xyplot(Y ~ X, scales=list(x = list(at = seq(0,1,.1), labels=LETTERS[1:11])))

